        "identifier": "https://github.com/LionSR/QICLean/blob/cbcd074b13584b75ae92072424c87147c07d1645/QICLean/Channel/Wigner/Upstream/WignerRigidity.lean",
        "note": "A port of this proof's csd-lean4 file, made in August 2026 with my copyright and split into several files. The repository builds its own results on top of it. Not an independent proof of the theorem.",
